WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
A wild goat escapes from confinement after being restrained for half an hour

2
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:27,710
It's you again. As expected, the skin can't be broken.

3
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:30,510
I'll let you go today, wait until my weapons are upgraded, and then I can settle the score.

4
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,100
Don't rush together and block the exit.

5
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:43,670
This Sister Xu Ya is in your hand

6
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:48,420
My stomach can't hold it back

7
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,220
I have driven him to your feet

8
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,420
You missed it yourself
